div.p:
2. Opp. to approach other foreign and domestic problems—SALT; Middle East;
                    Biol/Chem Warfare; MBFR; Berlin; trade; adjustment of US economy (DOD budgets
                    cut massively); allowing new uses of resources; modernization within DOD, allow
                    catch-up with USSR; prospects to go zero draft; concentrate on such major
                    initiatives as PRC/USSR trips; handle other crises like Mid East and S. Asia;
                    make generation of peace credible.

item.p:
Help RVNAF in air and sea power—more supplies and advice—moral support;
                            keep negotiations track open with DRV; try to get USSR and PRC to
                            diminish military aid levels.
